        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Don't worry about it. You're very polite.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Don't worry about it. You're very polite."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Ehehe...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Ehehe..."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Um, ma'am, what are you doing here?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Um, ma'am, what are you doing here?"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   It's still raining. You're not going to go inside?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "It's still raining. You're not going to go inside?"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Ah, um... I'm just... taking a walk.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Ah, um... I'm just... taking a walk."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Are you looking for help?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Are you looking for help?"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Oh! How'd you know?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Oh! How'd you know?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I can't tell you~ It's a secret.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I can't tell you~ It's a secret."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Aw... it's fine though!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Aw... it's fine though!"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Ma'am, do you think...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Ma'am, do you think..."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Hmm... that probably won't work. You're a bit too short...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Hmm... that probably won't work. You're a bit too short..."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Hey, you shouldn't say stuff like that! You're shorter than me!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Hey, you shouldn't say stuff like that! You're shorter than me!"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]  Whoa!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]  W-well, we could try... Um, could you help me move that board? Let's do it together!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "W-well, we could try... Um, could you help me move that board? Let's do it together!"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]  There's a record player under that metal rack. I want to take it back home.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "There's a record player under that metal rack. I want to take it back home."
    },
