        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But... this record player is broken.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But... this record player is broken."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   It's okay! It's always been broken.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "It's okay! It's always been broken."
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   But one day, I'll be able to fix it. I collected a lot of records, but I've never listened to them before...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "But one day, I'll be able to fix it. I collected a lot of records, but I've never listened to them before..."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   ...But one day, I'll play them for everyone!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "...But one day, I'll play them for everyone!"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
