        "raw": "[name=\"Child\"]   Ma'am, you're not scared of me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Child",
        "content": "Ma'am, you're not scared of me?"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...Scared of what?",
