        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   There's nothing wrong with being an Infected. Whether you are healthy or infected...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "There's nothing wrong with being an Infected. Whether you are healthy or infected..."
    },
