    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Even a child like that... In the end, will just...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Even a child like that... In the end, will just..."
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "Those who were robbed of their identity. The Infected. You've long lost the right to call yourselves people.",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "Those who were robbed of their identity. The Infected. You've long lost the right to call yourselves people."
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   What can I accomplish? What more... can I do...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "What can I accomplish? What more... can I do...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Why... can I not protect those around me...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Why... can I not protect those around me..."
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "You cannot.",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "You cannot."
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No... I...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No... I..."
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "Famine... Persecution... Death...",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "Famine... Persecution... Death..."
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "These are the only things awaiting the Infected.",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "These are the only things awaiting the Infected."
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No, that's not true...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No, that's not true..."
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   As long as Rhodes Island is fighting for the Infected...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "As long as Rhodes Island is fighting for the Infected..."
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "You are but one of the few lucky ones.",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "You are but one of the few lucky ones."
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
